P-11 (spec 017, the night shift; FR-029; G3's review, Important 1): the arrival check refuses, by name, a record step
naming Qwen-Image or FLUX [dev], so the gate itself refuses those outputs, not only line.py.

What it changes:
  - tools/gates/arrival_check.py: rule R8, in Record.step(). Any string of a step (its name, a model's name or
    repository, a tool's or a service's name) that names Qwen-Image, in any version ("qwen", anything but a letter,
    "image": Qwen-Image-2.1, Qwen2-Image, qwen_image), or FLUX with a "dev" no letter follows (FLUX.1 [dev],
    black-forest-labs/FLUX.1-dev), is a finding, "R8 <dir>/records.json: entries[i].steps[j] names Qwen-Image or FLUX
    [dev], whose outputs never ship, whatever the policy says (spec 017 FR-029)". It names the step, never the string.
    FLUX.2 [klein], FLUX.1 [schnell], Qwen3's text encoder, and Qwen2.5-VL aren't refused: the policy decides them.
    The docstring names the rule. Qwen-Image's pattern is broader than line.py's, which misses Qwen2-Image (G3's
    backlog); the gate is the stricter of the two.
  - tools/gates/test/test_arrival_check.py: seven refused spellings and four left to the policy.

Spec IDs: FR-029 ("SHALL refuse every Qwen-Image-2.1 and FLUX [dev] output"), decision 5.

Needed for: the studio line's first intake.

How to apply, on your own branch, from the repository's root (one line each):
  B=feat/017-g5-patches
  F=docs/merge-requests/2026-11-12-feat-017-p11.patch
  git show "refs/heads/$B:$F" > /tmp/p11.patch
  sha256sum /tmp/p11.patch
  patch -p1 --dry-run < /tmp/p11.patch
  patch -p1 < /tmp/p11.patch

Verified on a fresh `git archive refs/heads/main` export (main d4870ec8): dry run and apply clean; `pytest
tools/gates/test/test_arrival_check.py`: 287 passed (the new R8 tests against main's unpatched check: 7 failed,
4 passed, as they should). make publish-check reads every ref, so every ref was searched with R8's matcher: 253
refs, 751 records.json paths at their tips, and every records.json version reachable from them (9 distinct blobs):
no step refused. R8 refuses nothing already in history.

